<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <style type="text/css">
      body {
       font-family: Segoe UI; 
      }
      .container {
        padding: 30px;
        height: fit-content;
        border-radius: 5px 5px 0px 0px;
      }
      .container-success {
        background: #B7F5D280;
        border-top: 5px solid #4BCA81;
      }
      .container-warning {
        background: #fcf3e0;
        border-top: 5px solid #d79301;
      }
      .container-reminder {
        background: #B7DFF5;
        border-top: 5px solid #1178B1;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 30px;
        background: white;
      }
      .details-box {
        border: 1px solid #C9C9C9;
      }
      .padding-left-right-small {
        padding: 0px 20px;
      }
      .horizontal-bar {
        height: 1px;
        background: #C9C9C9;
      }
      .table-container td{
        padding: 10px;
        font-size: 12px;
      }
      .scheduled-time-cell {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .margin-right-xx_small {
        margin-right: 5px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
            <div class="container container-warning">
                <div class="content">
                    <p>
                        Bonjour [[RECIPIENT_NAME]],
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Votre rendez-vous de service avec <b>{!ServiceResource.Name}</b> du <b>{!DATETIMEVALUE(ServiceAppointment.SchedStartTime)} au {!DATETIMEVALUE(ServiceAppointment.SchedEndTime)} {!User.TimeZoneSidKey}</b> a été annulé.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Merci !
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
          </body>
</html>